<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Formal Employment Offer — {{designation}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1e293b;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      padding: 40px;
    }
    .header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #4f46e5;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #4f46e5;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .meta-box {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .meta-box strong {
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .details-table, .comp-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 20px 0 28px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .details-table th, .details-table td,
    .comp-table th, .comp-table td {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .details-table th, .comp-table th {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      color: #334155;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .comp-table tr.total-row td {
      background-color: #eef2ff;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #4338ca;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      background-color: #e0e7ff;
      color: #3730a3;
    }
    .portal-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef2ff 0%, #ede9fe 100%);
      border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 28px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .portal-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      color: #312e81;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .portal-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      background-color: #4f46e5;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding-top: 28px;
    }
    .signature-block {
      flex: 1;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .sig-line {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      height: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .watermark-notice {
      margin-top: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e1;
      padding-top: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div>
        <div class="logo">{{companyName}}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px;">Talent Acquisition & People Operations</div>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-box">
        <div><strong>Offer Ref:</strong> {{offerNumber}}</div>
        <div><strong>Date of Issue:</strong> {{issueDateFormatted}}</div>
        <div><strong>Valid Until:</strong> {{expiresAtFormatted}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1>Formal Employment Offer: {{designation}}</h1>

    <p>Dear <strong>{{candidateName}}</strong>,</p>

    <p>
      On behalf of <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>, we are thrilled to formally extend this offer of employment for the position of
      <strong>{{designation}}</strong> in the <strong>{{department}}</strong> department. Our team was deeply impressed with your technical expertise,
      collaborative mindset, and alignment with our mission.
    </p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14px; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Key Employment Terms</h3>
    <table class="details-table">
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 35%;">Designation / Role</th>
        <td><strong>{{designation}}</strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Department</th>
        <td>{{department}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Expected Joining Date</th>
        <td><strong>{{joiningDateFormatted}}</strong></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Work Mode & Location</th>
        <td><span class="badge">{{workMode}}</span> &mdash; {{workLocation}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Probationary Period</th>
        <td>{{probationMonths}} months from the effective date of joining</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Offer Validity</th>
        <td>7 calendar days (expires on {{expiresAtFormatted}})</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14px; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Annual Compensation Structure (CTC)</h3>
    <table class="comp-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Component</th>
          <th style="text-align: right; width: 40%;">Annual Amount (INR)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Annual Fixed Base Salary</td>
          <td style="text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px;">{{fixedSalaryFormatted}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Annual Performance Variable Component</td>
          <td style="text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px;">{{variableSalaryFormatted}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Joining & Retention Bonus</td>
          <td style="text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px;">{{bonusFormatted}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="total-row">
          <td>Total Cost to Company (CTC)</td>
          <td style="text-align: right; font-family: monospace; font-size: 15px;">{{totalCtcFormatted}}</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
      * Compensation is subject to applicable statutory deductions, provident fund contributions, and income tax withholdings in accordance with prevailing laws.
    </p>

    <div class="portal-box">
      <h3>Review & Digital Offer Acceptance</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 13px;">
        To accept this offer and review your complete digital employment contract, please access your single-use secure Candidate Portal link below:
      </p>
      {{#if portalUrl}}
        <a href="{{portalUrl}}" class="portal-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Open Secure Candidate Portal &rarr;
        </a>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; word-break: break-all;">
          Portal Link: {{portalUrl}}
        </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14px; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Terms and Conditions</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #475569;">
      {{termsAndConditions}}
    </p>

    <div class="signature-section">
      <div class="signature-block">
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
        <div><strong>{{signatoryName}}</strong></div>
        <div style="color: #64748b;">{{signatoryTitle}}</div>
        <div style="color: #64748b;">{{companyName}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="signature-block">
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
        <div><strong>{{candidateName}}</strong></div>
        <div style="color: #64748b;">Candidate Signature & Acceptance</div>
        <div style="color: #64748b;">Date: ____________________</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="watermark-notice">
      CONFIDENTIAL &mdash; This document contains proprietary information intended solely for the named recipient.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
